---

<Base
  title="Comunidad & Feed Oficial | The Garage Playa del Carmen"
  description="Feed en vivo extraído directamente de @thegarage.pdc. Distribuidores oficiales de Basso Bikes, rodadas comunitarias The Garage Ride de los viernes, nutrición Wayfar y comunidad ciclista en Playa del Carmen."
>
  <div class="comunidad-page-wrap">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      
      <!-- Top Stories Row -->
      <div class="stories-track-bar">
        {stories.map((story) => (
          <button type="button" class="story-tab-btn font-mono" data-filter={story.filter}>
            <span class="story-tag-pill">{story.tag}</span>
            <span class="story-name-label">{story.name}</span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <section class="comunidad-hero-section">
        <div class="comunidad-hero-content">
          <div class="comunidad-badges font-mono">
            <span class="badge-ig-live">FEED OFICIAL @THEGARAGE.PDC</span>
            <span class="badge-loc">PLAYA DEL CARMEN, Q.R.</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="title-xl" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
            Comunidad, Rodadas &amp; Eventos.
          </h1>
          <p class="subtitle" style="max-width: 720px;">
            Publicaciones originales extraídas de nuestro Instagram. Salidas semanales de los viernes <strong>The Garage Ride</strong>, la academia <strong>The Garage Racing Team</strong>, distribución oficial de <strong>Basso Bikes</strong> y nutrición <strong>Wayfar</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/thegarage.pdc/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn btn-primary"
        >
          <span>Seguir en Instagram ↗</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Media Grid -->
      <div class="media-grid-container">
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <article class="media-feed-card" data-tipo={post.tipo}>
            <a
              href={post.permalink}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="media-view-box"
              title="Abrir post original en Instagram"
            >
              <img src={post.imagen} alt={post.titulo} loading="lazy" width="640" height="640" />
              <div class="media-tag-badge font-mono">
                {post.badge}
              </div>
            </a>

            <div class="media-body-box">
              <span class="media-cat-label font-mono">[{post.categoria.toUpperCase()}]</span>
              <h2 class="media-card-title">{post.titulo}</h2>
              <p class="media-card-desc">{post.descripcion}</p>

              <div class="media-actions-row">
                <a
                  href={`https://wa.me/529841381493?text=Hola,%20vi%20la%20publicaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20${encodeURIComponent(post.titulo)}%20(${post.permalink})%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n.`}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="btn btn-whatsapp media-btn-wa"
                >
                  Consultar por WhatsApp
                </a>
                <a
                  href={post.permalink}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="btn btn-outline media-btn-post font-mono"
                >
                  Post ↗
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <!-- GOOGLE BUSINESS PROFILE REVIEWS (4.95 / 5) SOCIAL PROOF                -->
      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section class="comunidad-reviews-section">
        <div class="comunidad-reviews-box">
          <div class="reviews-header-flex">
            <div class="reviews-brand-info">
              <div class="google-logo-pill">
                <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path fill="#4285F4" d="M23.745 12.27c0-.7-.06-1.4-.19-2.07H12v4.51h6.6c-.29 1.52-1.14 2.82-2.4 3.68v3.05h3.88c2.27-2.09 3.665-5.17 3.665-9.17Z"/>
                  <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 24c3.24 0 5.95-1.08 7.93-2.91l-3.88-3.05c-1.08.72-2.45 1.16-4.05 1.16-3.12 0-5.77-2.1-6.72-4.93H1.25v3.15C3.26 21.36 7.35 24 12 24Z"/>
                  <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.28 14.27c-.25-.72-.38-1.49-.38-2.27s.13-1.55.38-2.27V6.58H1.25C.45 8.18 0 9.98 0 12s.45 3.82 1.25 5.42l4.03-3.15Z"/>
                  <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 4.75c1.77 0 3.35.61 4.6 1.8l3.42-3.42C17.95 1.19 15.24 0 12 0 7.35 0 3.26 2.64 1.25 6.58l4.03 3.15c.95-2.83 3.6-4.98 6.72-4.98Z"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="font-mono" style="font-weight:800; font-size:0.85rem; color:#ffffff;">Google Reviews</span>
              </div>
              <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; margin:0.4rem 0 0.2rem; color:#ffffff;">
                4.95 de 5.0 Estrellas · Opiniones de Nuestra Comunidad
              </h2>
              <p style="color:#a1a1aa; font-size:0.9rem; margin:0;">
                Calificaciones de ciclistas locales, triatletas y visitantes en Playa del Carmen y la Riviera Maya.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rating-badge-summary">
              <div class="stars-gold"><span style="display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:#f59e0b;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></span></div>
              <span class="badge-verified-num font-mono">38 RESEÑAS VERIFICADAS</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="comunidad-reviews-grid">
            <div class="com-review-card">
              <div class="cr-top">
                <div class="cr-stars"><span style="display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:#f59e0b;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></span></div>
                <span class="cr-source font-mono">Google Maps</span>
              </div>
              <p class="cr-quote">"El mejor servicio mecánico de Playa del Carmen sin duda. Llevé mi bicicleta de ruta para cambio de chicotes y centrado de ruedas; quedó suave y precisa como de fábrica. Taller 100% profesional."</p>
              <div class="cr-user">
                <div class="cr-avatar" style="background:#0071e3;">RP</div>
                <div>
                  <strong>Roberto Pech</strong>
                  <span>Ciclista de Ruta · Playacar</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="com-review-card">
              <div class="cr-top">
                <div class="cr-stars"><span style="display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:#f59e0b;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></span></div>
                <span class="cr-source font-mono">Google Maps</span>
              </div>
              <p class="cr-quote">"Compré la Basso Palta II para gravel y la asesoría fue insuperable. Me calcularon el fit exacto, montaron el tubeless con Stan's y me la entregaron lista para salir a rodar. Excelente atención."</p>
              <div class="cr-user">
                <div class="cr-avatar" style="background:#ff9500;">CM</div>
                <div>
                  <strong>Carlos Méndez</strong>
                  <span>Gravel Rider · Playa del Carmen</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="com-review-card">
              <div class="cr-top">
                <div class="cr-stars"><span style="display:inline-flex; gap:2px; color:#f59e0b;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg></span></div>
                <span class="cr-source font-mono">Google Maps</span>
              </div>
              <p class="cr-quote">"Las rodadas de los viernes son increíbles. Muy buen ambiente, excelente organización con barredora y soporte técnico. Además los geles y sales Wayfar en tienda salvan los entrenos con humedad."</p>
              <div class="cr-user">
                <div class="cr-avatar" style="background:#34c759;">AP</div>
                <div>
